{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} Macro Instructions}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} Macro_Instructions}
\pard \f4\fs36 Macro Instructions\f2\fs20 
\par \f4\fs24 
\par A macro is a set of macro instructions which are executed in sequence (except for \ul control structures\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Control_Structures}). If the macro is displayed in the macro window the instruction currently being executed is highlighted. If an instruction fails to execute it will repeatedly attempt to execute until either \ul stop\plain\f4\fs24  is pressed or it \ul times out\plain\f4\fs24 .
\par 
\par The following macro instructions are provided:
\par 
\par \ul Call Macro\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Call_Macro}
\par \ul Comment\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Comment}
\par \ul Confirm Configuration\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Confirm_Configuration}
\par \pard \ul \ul Delay\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Delay}
\par \ul Else\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Else}
\par \ul End If\plain\f4\fs24 {\v End_If}
\par \ul End a Macro\plain\f4\fs24 {\v End_The_Macro}
\par \ul End While\plain\f4\fs24 {\v End_While}
\par \ul Execute Command\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Execute_Command}
\par \ul Execute Program\plain\f4\fs24 {\v 1KGATAT}
\par \ul Hide Control Panel\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Hide_Control_Panel}
\par \ul Hide Panel\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Hide_Panel}
\par \ul Hide Panels\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Hide_Panels}
\par \ul If Then\plain\f4\fs24 {\v If_Then}
\par \ul Knob\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Knob}
\par \uldb Look up Table Functions\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Look_up_Table_Functions}
\par \ul Message\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Message}
\par \ul Mouse Assignment\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Mouse_Assignment}
\par \ul Pause\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Pause}
\par \ul Set Analogue Pair\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Set_Analogue_Pair}
\par \ul Set Analogue Parameter\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Set_Analogue_Parameter}
\par \ul Set Digital State\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Set_Digital_State}
\par \ul Show Control Panel\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Show_Control_Panel}
\par \ul Show Control Tab\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Show_Control_Tab}
\par \ul Show Panel\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Show_Panel}
\par \pard \ul \ul Show Panels\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Show_Panels}
\par \ul Special Functions\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Special_Functions}
\par \ul Stage Goto First Point\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Stage_Goto_First_Point}
