\par The message box may just contain an OK button or Yes/No buttons
\par 
\par If the \ul Message type\plain\f4\fs24 {\v 0JPV9B} is Yes/No then a defined \ul flag variable\plain\f4\fs24 {\v Flag_Variables__Semaphores_} will be set to 0 if \b No\plain\f4\fs24  is pressed or set to 1 if \b Yes\plain\f4\fs24  is pressed.
\par 
\par  Execution is suspended until a button  is clicked.\f2\fs20 
\par \page
