\par 
\par If a simple Message box is required (displays an \b OK\plain\fs24  button and the defined message text) then the \b YesNo Box \plain\fs24 checkbox should be unchecked.
\par 
\par If the \b YesNo Box\plain\fs24  checkbox is checked then the message box will have \b Yes\plain\fs24  and \b No\plain\fs24  buttons.
\par In this case select one of the \ul Flag Variables\plain\fs24 {\v Flag_Variables__Semaphores_} which will be set according to the button pressed by the user.
\par \pard \b No\plain\fs24  pressed sets variable = 0
\par \b Yes\plain\fs24  pressed sets variable = 1
\par \page
