\par 
\par If the current point is the last in the list the digital parameter \b Points List\plain\fs24  will be set to\b  At End. 
\par \plain\fs24 For a loop use \uldb While Not at end list\plain\fs24 {\v Stage_While_not_at_end_of_list}.
